## Key Concepts
- PCA basics: imputation, scaling, centering
- Global vs per-tenant PCA; explained variance threshold
- Loadings interpretation; cohort definition
- Latency considerations: batch vs streaming; incremental options

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudocode illustrating preprocessing and PCA call
function buildPCA(data) {
  const imputed = imputeMeanPerFeature(data);
  const scaled = scaleToUnitVariance(imputed);
  // assume PCA is available and returns components/loadings
  const pca = new PCA(scaled, {nComponents: 6});
  return pca.loadings;
}
```

